<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερουσί-α</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Council of Elders, senate</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				401
			</span></i>: esp. at Sparta, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1270b24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(2).345.10
			</span></i> (Orchom. <i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, <span class="entity">ii/i B. C.</span>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γερωΐα</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεροντία</span>; also of the Carthaginian
			<u>Senate</u>, 
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1272b37
			</span></i>; and the Roman, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.789e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.97b
			</span></i>; of the Jewish <i>Sanhedrin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				5.21
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sacred college</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερὰ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.702
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Eleusis</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.2808
			</span></i> (Hyettus, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρεσβεία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				936
			</span></i>.</div>
